    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 137,
        "text": "Okay, everyone, thanks for coming to the community garden meeting. We need to decide how to spend the 500 pounds we raised. Any ideas?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "fafbae02da4513dbab40813fbe5c0c8b487826c7af8cda2489d2ca32f937be81",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 141,
        "sourceEnd": 223,
        "text": "Yes, I think we should buy new tools. The old ones are rusty, and some are broken.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "eaa88c28879e9a428fe9af9afdd1f074181e6495f160a828b8e1c26ebcf733dd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 227,
        "sourceEnd": 329,
        "text": "That's a good point. But we also need to fix the fence. It's falling down, and rabbits are getting in.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4e51588998f9079781926059859852dc75133e1dc8e1b8f47660f1cdf608b4f6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 333,
        "sourceEnd": 432,
        "text": "True. But if we buy tools first, we can start planting sooner. The fence can wait until next month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "169d98e2d94b375d7de08e5695a40b77804c401c11dc365f4b304fc94d2b6067",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 436,
        "sourceEnd": 554,
        "text": "Hmm, but if we don't fix the fence now, the rabbits will eat the young plants. So maybe we should fix the fence first.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "1c0877fecd0ef5cafad09d5e2ff80f81cc9129a12f9dc0bfcdc38c2a7038e44a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 558,
        "sourceEnd": 682,
        "text": "I see what you mean. But tools are cheaper than a new fence. We could buy tools and still have money left for fence repairs.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "41f833a96bb8d013beb11001a805bc264f6a6f664e2421afbd2524eb82686434",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 686,
        "sourceEnd": 728,
        "text": "How much do you think the fence will cost?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f69d995f8a9a5f17649cc4bb7d42cb0c0268e64b6003420d52ba2ed838e0cc27",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 732,
        "sourceEnd": 812,
        "text": "I asked a builder. He said 200 pounds for materials if we do the work ourselves.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3aeaeba28f036645c3cfa65dae3f61e74c1f6a79e1880181e4435c052bd0f080",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 816,
        "sourceEnd": 845,
        "text": "That's reasonable. And tools?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6729317f2ff7602ef91b456a493f5a9155b443a6fa0030139794d84350ba794a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 850,
        "sourceEnd": 883,
        "text": "About 150 pounds for a basic set.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b732b4ca61a9813840bf7435ab31818faf094df79e65e9124a374aa3dbb17856",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 887,
        "sourceEnd": 948,
        "text": "So that's 350 pounds total. We have 500. What about the rest?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "07c74cd77df78ab1b15b87c2b20e81c5eb7bdccae4772050c477da66c491279f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 952,
        "sourceEnd": 1012,
        "text": "We could buy seeds and fertilizer. Or save it for next year.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "aff38460700c4e9511fd1f758a9cc7d4168009ce869150a97e2e9639bcc002c7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1016,
        "sourceEnd": 1126,
        "text": "I think we should also consider a water barrel. It collects rain, so we save water. It costs around 80 pounds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "174755c84ce468c5dcd2f388b072db84bd23162a6d6dd97720fc1088a0f79fa0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1130,
        "sourceEnd": 1223,
        "text": "That's a good idea. Although, if we buy the barrel, we'll have only 70 pounds left for seeds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cba278c6f919ca533d261446c08e31ad0a70d004514d8c0d4aa663524d31e9ca",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1227,
        "sourceEnd": 1302,
        "text": "True. But seeds are cheap. We can buy enough for the season with 70 pounds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "fbe05bc598a813bda3fad5b8f7f4418b39b60f13df29dda3ec567e56df214c70",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1306,
        "sourceEnd": 1400,
        "text": "Okay, so let's decide: fence first, then tools, then water barrel, and seeds with what's left.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cb21a4c2791e98dd55a220021782ccc82596231ff4359f7a5189a259466358f8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1404,
        "sourceEnd": 1442,
        "text": "Wait, I thought we agreed tools first?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "eed0d58364acbb25551905ea55d6c7031726a3fcf3c589d35fa41597878da38f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1447,
        "sourceEnd": 1501,
        "text": "No, you said fence first because of rabbits. I agreed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "121f579d3596e6d6aa380cb5fc9efd2444b0bbbec2ce1a6327293bea01c53bf4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1505,
        "sourceEnd": 1609,
        "text": "Oh right, sorry. So fence, tools, barrel, seeds. That's 200 + 150 + 80 = 430. We have 70 left for seeds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "12f82056c177c5223bd65936986ec2b6f236189eddbda21dd4f37777417628bd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1613,
        "sourceEnd": 1656,
        "text": "Perfect. But we need to vote. All in favor?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8cfd3b2a6d92290b3be7e41130a34b5ebb9b4c85ce6105b0454a38375b3038e4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1660,
        "sourceEnd": 1664,
        "text": "Aye.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f4c4d8762552842b974d910b43e47c21cc5fffee74e3ef569bda8d697a86e8d4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1668,
        "sourceEnd": 1695,
        "text": "Aye. Great, meeting closed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fc1c032030b8033ae81d962b3d40c26054a20caac1f4e6c3fcb4bcf4929611f1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
